            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-7017-perl-base",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-7017 high vulnerability for perl-base package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "HTTP::Tiny versions before 0.095 for Perl forward credential headers to cross-origin redirect targets.  When the server returns a 3xx redirect, `_maybe_redirect` follows the `Location:` header and `_prepare_headers_and_cb` re-merges the caller's `headers` argument into the new request, without checking whether the redirect target shares an origin with the original URL. Caller-supplied `Authorization`, `Cookie` and `Proxy-Authorization` headers are therefore re-sent to whatever host the redirect names, across scheme, host or port boundaries, and including `https` to `http` downgrades that expose them in plaintext on the wire.  The HTTP::Tiny POD note that \"Authorization headers will not be included in a redirected request\" applied only to the URL-userinfo Basic-auth path, not to headers passed explicitly by the caller."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-7017",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-7017\nSeverity: high\nPackage: perl-base\nVersion: 5.42.2-3\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:unstable\nLink: [CVE-2026-7017](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-7017)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-7017**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | perl-base  | 5.42.2-3  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:unstable  | [CVE-2026-7017](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-7017)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/perl-base@5.42.2-3?arch=amd64\u0026distro=debian\u0026upstream=perl"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.1"
              }
            },
